           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/powershell/" title="View all posts in Powershell" rel="category tag">Powershell</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/tfs/" title="View all posts in TFS" rel="category tag">TFS</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/visual-studio/" title="View all posts in Visual Studio" rel="category tag">Visual Studio</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/real-world-webcast-series-for-tfs-2010/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Real World Webcast Series for TFS 2010"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="877 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/real-world-webcast-series-for-tfs-2010/">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

