           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/net/" title="View all posts in .Net" rel="category tag">.Net</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/visual-studio/" title="View all posts in Visual Studio" rel="category tag">Visual Studio</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2008/07/virtual-property-c-code-snippet/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Virtual Property C# Code Snippet"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="713 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/07/02/virtual-property-c-code-snippet.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
